WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:08.000 line:88%
This commercial was supposed to show beautiful images

00:08.000 --> 00:15.000 line:88%
of people with intellectual disabilities working,
playing, studying, living a normal life.

00:15.000 --> 00:21.000 line:88%
It doesn't. Because we'd rather spend our resources
improving the lives of people with disabilities.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.500 line:88%
Our commercials will stay this simple.
But the lives of people with disabilities will get much better.

